              "text": "A Lenovo ThinkCentre M720q I set up as an always-on Linux server.\n\n- Debian with Runtipi to deploy self-hosted apps in Docker\n- Hosts this website through a Cloudflare Tunnel\n- Runs a Navidrome music server at music.raidenbrundin.com\n- Runs a public Minecraft server with Crafty Controller\n- Remote admin access over Tailscale; router port forwarding configured on a Bell Giga Hub",
              "url": ""
            },
            {
              "icon": "m",
