                "Troubleshooting"
              ],
              "text": "Built my own desktop (Intel i9-10900K, RTX 3080) and have run Arch-based distros, elementary OS and now Kubuntu on it.\n\n- Resolved Intel RAID/VMD vs AHCI storage conflicts and GRUB boot problems\n- Set up dual-booting Linux and Windows on separate NVMe drives\n- Configured NVIDIA drivers and a video editing setup on Linux",
